@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@cityId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@requestId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@sessionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@exerciseId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
@submissionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005

# TODO : Set URL/IDs; these operations are unimplemented. Reuse a submission ID only for an identical retry.
### Preview Today
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/learning/today?cityId={{cityId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Start or resume a stable session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/learning/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"cityId":"{{cityId}}","clientRequestId":"{{requestId}}","sessionKind":"daily"}

### Answer payload format is provisional
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/learning/sessions/{{sessionId}}/answers
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"exerciseId":"{{exerciseId}}","clientSubmissionId":"{{submissionId}}","answer":{"selectedOptionId":"REPLACE_WITH_SERVER_OPTION_ID"}}
